s","url":"https://www.w3.org/WAI/tutorials/images/","accessStatus":"verified-content","checkedAt":"2026-10-24","basis":"Image purpose determines alternatives; decorative and informative content differ."},{"id":"wai-textual","url":"https://www.w3.org/WAI/tutorials/images/textual/","title":"WAI images of text","accessStatus":"primary-content","checkedAt":"2026-10-29","basis":"Use genuine text where the host supports it. Studio editable overlays are separate from native HTML and still rasterize in image exports."}],"treatmentKnowledge.packs.1.sources":[{"id":"studio-editorial","title":"Studio creative treatment synthesis","url":"repo:docs/format-treatment-playbook.md","accessStatus":"editorial","checkedAt":"2026-10-24","basis":"Original design recommendations for this product, informed by the listed sources. Not platform requirements or proven performance claims."},{"id":"wai-complex","title":"W3C complex images","url":"https://www.w3.org/WAI/tutorials/images/complex/","accessStatus":"verified-content","checkedAt":"2026-10-24","basis":"Complex visual information needs an equivalent textual explanation; images alone do not establish accessible document delivery."}],"placements.0.expanded.sources":[{"id":"editorial","title":"Creative AI placement design principles","url":"local:knowledge/design-principles.md","publisher":"Creative AI","authority":"editorial","accessStatus":"editorial","accessCheckedAt":"2026-10-04","verifiedAt":null,"sourceVersion":"page observed 2026-10-04","section":"","summary":"","limitations":"Authored heuristics; no measured performance claim; evaluated 2026-10-04."},{"id":"user:studio-output-presets","title":"Selected Studio output presets","url":"user-supplied:creative-ai-output-presets","verifiedAt":"2026-10-09","limitations":"Application presets selected in the brief. Physical sizes and margins are editable job specifications, not universal printer standards. Raster/PDF proofs do not certify publisher or press acceptance.","publisher":"user","authority":"user","accessStatus":"user-provided","accessCheckedAt":"2026-10-09","sourceVersion":"1.0.0"},{"id":"user:studio-placement-logo-policy","title":"Client placement logo policy v1","url":"user-supplied:studio-placement-logo-policy","verifiedAt":"2026-10-15"}],"facts":[{"id":"indian-brand-description","kind":"brand","text":"Sleepyhead’s official FAQ describes it as an Indian brand.","status":"supported","sourceIds":["source-1"],"essential":false}],"guardian.requirements":[{"id":"req-logo-integrity","text":"Use authentic Sleepyhead logo artwork and appropriate supplied variant; preserve its proportions, colours, contrast and clear space. Do not rotate, distort, recolour, bevel, emboss or add a drop shadow. No production logo artwork is present in the supplied materials.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"req-colour-source","text":"The excerpts specify orange #F15A22 and charcoal #414042. The white specification conflicts: RGB indicates #FFFFFF, while the printed hex is #231F20. Treat white as unresolved; do not use #231F20 as white.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"req-typeface","text":"The excerpts name Migrena Grotesque for brand typography and Source Sans Pro for web typography. Font availability and licensing are unconfirmed; do not claim exact rendering unless verified.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"req-coherent-design","text":"Keep selected colours, patterns and mixed design elements cohesive; the excerpts call for bold colour, playful patterns and asymmetry.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]}],"guardian.preferences":[{"id":"pref-personality","text":"Supplied excerpts describe a human-centred, young/vibrant, quirky and playful Jester identity focused on connection and enjoyment. This is supplied positioning, not proof of audience response.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"pref-voice","text":"Favor humorous, informal, creative and personable language; keep it useful and clear, and avoid unsupported product promises.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"pref-whole-room","text":"As advisory inspiration, consider the whole domestic space—architecture, circulation, colour relationships, daylight, furniture grouping and lived-in activity. Expressive, patterned rooms and quieter alternatives are both represented; no single room formula is required.","sourceIds":["doc-53349b2d-6eab-42f9-8222-b0a1b50885f0","asset-1bdc023f-440d-4f44-8f17-0662226f73f8","asset-4ad0772f-7386-4f4b-9bbc-385d115a7455"]},{"id":"pref-current-site","text":"The official site currently presents a broad home-comfort range and uses the lowercase Sleepyhead wordmark with orange accents. This is an observation, not a mandatory campaign template.","sourceIds":["source-1","source-5"]}],"guardian.visualRules":[{"id":"rule-palette-orange","domain":"palette","value":"Use the supplied brand orange #F15A22 as a specified brand colour.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"rule-palette-charcoal","domain":"palette","value":"Use the supplied charcoal #414042 as a specified brand colour.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"rule-logo","domain":"logo","value":"Preserve authentic logo artwork, proportions and clear space; do not rotate, distort, recolour, bevel, emboss or add a drop shadow. Prefer the master mark for general communication and use an appropriate authentic variant.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"rule-type","domain":"typography","value":"The supplied excerpts specify Migrena Grotesque for brand typography and Source Sans Pro for web typography. Exact font rendering is subject to availability and verification.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"rule-spatial-cohesion","domain":"layout","value":"Keep selected playful colours, patterns and mixed styles tied together by a coherent palette or design theme; the supplied excerpts also call for asymmetry.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]}],"brandResearch.sources":[{"id":"source-1","kind":"site","status":"available","label":"Official brand website"},{"id":"source-5","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Sleepyhead logo"},{"id":"source-8","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Official page image"},{"id":"source-9","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Official page image"},{"id":"source-10","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Official page image"},{"id":"doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10","kind":"guidelines","status":"partial","label":"Visual world guide (supplied)","note":"All 1 sections indexed. 1 sections selected as text evidence; 0 actual visual references available. Consumer observations are research context; positioning claims are not product efficacy proof. Reference samples are inspiration, not mandatory rules.  53 saved visual references omitted from this bounded context; originals remain in the library."},{"id":"doc-53349b2d-6eab-42f9-8222-b0a1b50885f0","kind":"guidelines","status":"partial","label":"Supplied reference material (supplied)","note":"All 4 sections indexed. 4 sections selected as text evidence; 0 actual visual references available. Consumer observations are research context; positioning claims are not product efficacy proof. Reference samples are inspiration, not mandatory rules. "},{"id":"asset-f455e529-b2b2-4944-b889-624c926d6bcf","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Visual guidelines · Sleepyhead S14 guideline excerpt.png","note":"Actual image available as a visual reference in this brand’s next research refresh. Samples are not mandatory rules or product proof."},{"id":"asset-808c6451-265c-43e1-aa67-53fafd54f52d","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Visual guidelines · Sleepyhead S13 guideline excerpt.png","note":"Actual image available as a visual reference in this brand’s next research refresh. Samples are not mandatory rules or product proof."},{"id":"asset-aae80100-00e7-4b25-ad96-67df3e41702f","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Visual guidelines · Sleepyhead S02 guideline excerpt.png","note":"Actual image available as a visual reference in this brand’s next research refresh. Samples are not mandatory rules or product proof."},{"id":"asset-c4381a7b-d5aa-46af-95a9-7e2150bd0e23","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Visual guidelines · Sleepyhead S01 guideline excerpt.png","note":"Actual image available as a visual reference in this brand’s next research refresh. Samples are not mandatory rules or product proof."},{"id":"asset-fe0205c8-6774-40f4-9b95-f0e6827e968e","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Visual guidelines · Sleepyhead S05 guideline excerpt.png","note":"Actual image available as a visual reference in this brand’s next research refresh. Samples are not mandatory rules or product proof."},{"id":"asset-d40ad768-1016-434e-af72-e29b24fc08ac","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Visual guidelines · Sleepyhead S06 guideline excerpt.png","note":"Actual image available as a visual reference in this brand’s next research refresh. Samples are not mandatory rules or product proof."},{"id":"asset-1bdc023f-440d-4f44-8f17-0662226f73f8","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Sample creatives · Sleepyhead P001 spatial inspiration.jpg","note":"Actual image available as a visual reference in this brand’s next research refresh. Samples are not mandatory rules or product proof."},{"id":"asset-4ad0772f-7386-4f4b-9bbc-385d115a7455","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Sample creatives · Sleepyhead P022 spatial inspiration.jpg","note":"Actual image available as a visual reference in this brand’s next research refresh. Samples are not mandatory rules or product proof."},{"id":"source-approved-logo-asset-bc73e039c13b91fe41fd2951","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Approved brand library logo: Sleepyhead approved orange-charcoal · transparent","note":"User-approved uploaded logo 2026-10-15. Deterministic background removal explicitly authorized; shapes and opaque source pixels preserved. See approved-logos/2026-10-15/manifest.json. Two-tone logo; ensure BOTH colours contrast with background."}],"brandResearch.findings":[{"section":"overview","basis":"evidence","title":"Sleep and home-comfort range","text":"Sleepyhead’s official site presents a broad home-comfort range including mattresses, beds, sofas, sofa beds, recliners, pillows and other home furnishings. The site describes the brand as Indian.","sourceIds":["source-1"]},{"section":"identity","basis":"evidence","title":"Supplied identity guidance","text":"The supplied Sleepyhead guideline excerpts describe a human-centred, young/vibrant, quirky and fabulous identity, with a Jester archetype focused on connection and enjoyment. The excerpts are partial; their original version and approval status are not established.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10","asset-aae80100-00e7-4b25-ad96-67df3e41702f","asset-c4381a7b-d5aa-46af-95a9-7e2150bd0e23"]},{"section":"identity","basis":"evidence","title":"Colour, typography and mark","text":"Guideline excerpts specify orange #F15A22 and charcoal #414042, and name Migrena Grotesque for brand typography and Source Sans Pro for web typography. The supplied white specification conflicts: RGB 255,255,255 implies #FFFFFF, while the printed hex is #231F20; treat #FFFFFF as an interpretation pending correction. The guide describes a lowercase wordmark and closed-eye “ee” motif; no production logo artwork or Migrena Grotesque font files are supplied.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10","asset-f455e529-b2b2-4944-b889-624c926d6bcf","asset-808c6451-265c-43e1-aa67-53fafd54f52d","asset-d40ad768-1016-434e-af72-e29b24fc08ac"]},{"section":"tone","basis":"evidence","title":"Conversational, playful voice","text":"Supplied voice guidance favours humorous, informal, creative and personable language, including wit and wordplay, while remaining useful and clear and avoiding unsupported product promises.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10","asset-fe0205c8-6774-40f4-9b95-f0e6827e968e"]}],"assets":[{"id":"approved-logo-asset-bc73e039c13b91fe41fd2951","kind":"logo","label":"Approved production logo from this brand library: Sleepyhead approved orange-charcoal · transparent","sourceIds":["source-approved-logo-asset-bc73e039c13b91fe41fd2951"],"brandId":"brand-3a5870df-d114-43eb-ba02-e5d8c3c729de"}]}}}
